This directory vendors the AArch64 serial bootloader from:

  bztsrc/raspi3-tutorial — tutorial 14 "raspbootin64"
  https://github.com/bztsrc/raspi3-tutorial/tree/master/14_raspbootin64
  Copyright (C) 2018 bzt (bztsrc@github) — MIT License

itself a 64-bit rewrite of mrvn/raspbootin.

Files start.S, uart.c, uart.h, mbox.c, mbox.h, gpio.h, link.ld are used
verbatim; each carries the upstream MIT header. main.c is modified — see the
header comment in that file.
